 experiences in Vietnam will change him forever and even the relationship to his family on another continent, watching his mission from afar. They can reach him only by writing letters ...", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 39, "name": "Warfare"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/air-conflicts-vietnam", "videos": [{"id": 51570, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Fs9-5c8k5T8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fs9-5c8k5T8", "title": "Air Conflicts Vietnam PS4 launch trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Fs9-5c8k5T8/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 633, "name": "Air Conflicts"}]}